The comparison is already a single `cmp/setne`; the only gain is to tell the compiler the valid case is the hot path so callers can lay out branches better, and to mark the getter `pure` so it can be hoisted/CSE'd across calls.

```cpp
FIT_BOOL Field::IsValid(void) const
{
    return __builtin_expect(profileIndex != FIT_UINT16_INVALID, 1);
}
```